<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan auction raises 125.25 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan auction raises 125.25 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 125.25 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (Central Bank) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rate unchanged and bids accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY    BID   AMOUNT   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    13 weeks     20	20	7.50 pct</p>
<p>    52 weeks     91.25   91.25   9.00</p>
<p>    Two years     6	 6	9.50</p>
<p>    Five years    8	 8	10.00</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	 125.25   125.25</p>
<p>($1= 8.7 dirhams)</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom (212-7) 726518</p>
</text>
